@ [canonical_uuid] a339230c-47aa-46a2-9bda-12c5960fb318

& [Need]
  + live ls-remote cannot be mandatory inside a no-network effect authority
  + silently omitting either clause would invalidate governed execution

& [CorrectionChoice]
  + remote equality is already a publication responsibility and belongs in a committed supervising proof
  + local preparer needs only hash-pinned proof correspondence and local HEAD tracking origin equality
  + a later physical commission can pin future implementation identities without guessing them during formation

& [LeastAuthority]
  + Revision 0.2 restores provider-free implementation only and keeps the physical attempt separately locked
  + command plan contains zero network processes and one explicitly modeled future mutation

& [Value]
  + implementation can now be exact testable and noncontradictory while preserving the route to a real external candidate
